{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Sqrt"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton.lean#L92-L124","doc":"**q-Plancherel asymptotic skeleton — fluctuation vanishing**\n([`prop:q-plancherel-asymptotic-skeleton`]).\n\nThe character fluctuations vanish in the large-`n` limit:\n`char_variance n → 0`.\n\n**Derived** by squeezing the assumed majorant `1/√(n − 3)` (which\nitself tends to `0`, proved here via `Real.sqrt` continuity at `0`)\nagainst the non-negative variance. This is the measure-concentration\ncontent the manuscript's clauses 1–2 rest on — a consequence of the\nhypothesis, not a projection of it. The squeeze needs only that the\nmajorant tends to `0`; it does not depend on where the majorant came\nfrom, which is why the unsourced provenance does not touch the\ntheorem. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:q-plancherel-asymptotic-skeleton","label":"prop:q-plancherel-asymptotic-skeleton","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/q-plancherel-asymptotic-skeleton.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeletonContext.variance_majorant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeletonContext.variance_majorant","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton.lean#L89-L89","doc":"**Assumed majorant**: the character fluctuations have variance\n`O(1/√(n − 3))`. This is an ASSUMPTION of the context, not a cited\ntheorem — see the module docstring: the `1/√(n − 3)` form does not\noccur in Féray–Méliot, and no source for it has been identified.\nRenamed from `feray_meliot_bound` on 2026-09-05 so the name stops\nasserting a provenance the corpus cannot produce. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeletonContext.variance_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeletonContext.variance_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton.lean#L82-L82","doc":"The variance is non-negative (it is a variance). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeletonContext.char_variance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeletonContext.char_variance","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton.lean#L80-L80","doc":"Variance of the character fluctuations `χ_λ − 𝔼_q[χ]` at strand\ncount `n`, measured under the pushforward measure `μ_n^{(q)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeletonContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeletonContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton.lean#L77-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeletonContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeletonContext","kind":"class","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton.lean#L72-L90","doc":"**Inputs** for the q-Plancherel asymptotic skeleton. The variance\nmajorant is an *assumption* (its `1/√(n − 3)` form is unsourced — see\nthe module docstring); the theorem `QPlancherelAsymptoticSkeleton`\n**derives** the asymptotic vanishing of the fluctuations from it,\nrather than re-emitting it. ","signatureChunk":0}]}